GET http://localhost:8085/api/citizens/all

###
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/all

### B1 - citizens in a village (case-insensitive, ordered by last name)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/citizens/by-village?village=nyagatovu

### B2 - enrollments by status (ordered by date)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/by-status?status=APPLIED

### B3 - enrollments between two dates
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/between?start=2026-10-01&end=2026-10-31

### C1 - enrollment officers holding a household category
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollment-officers/by-household-category?name=ubudehe%201

### C2 - sectors without an enrollment officer
GET http://localhost:8085/api/sectors/free

### C3 - household categories not held by any enrollment officer
GET http://localhost:8085/api/household-categories/unused

### C4 - distinct citizens of an enrollment officer
GET http://localhost:8085/api/citizens/of-enrollment-officer/PASTE_ALICE_ID_HERE

### D1 - save with a past date (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-09-01",
  "coverageYear": 2026,
  "premium": 3000,
  "citizen": { "id": "PASTE_CITIZEN1_ID_HERE" },
  "enrollmentOfficer": { "id": "PASTE_ALICE_ID_HERE" }
}

### D1 - officer already active that day (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-10-17",
  "coverageYear": 2026,
  "premium": 3000,
  "citizen": { "id": "PASTE_CITIZEN2_ID_HERE" },
  "enrollmentOfficer": { "id": "PASTE_ALICE_ID_HERE" }
}

### D1 - valid save (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-12-20",
  "coverageYear": 2026,
  "premium": 3000,
  "status": "PAYMENT_PENDING",
  "citizen": { "id": "PASTE_CITIZEN1_ID_HERE" },
  "enrollmentOfficer": { "id": "PASTE_ERIC_ID_HERE" }
}

### D2 - change status (valid transition)
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/PASTE_ENROLLMENT_ID_HERE/status?status=PAYMENT_PENDING

### D2 - change status (forbidden transition, expect 400)
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/PASTE_ENROLLMENT_ID_HERE/status?status=APPLIED

### D3 - assign a household category to an enrollment officer
PUT http://localhost:8085/api/enrollment-officers/PASTE_ALICE_ID_HERE/household-categories/PASTE_UBUDEHE3_ID_HERE

### D4 - move an enrollment officer to a sector
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/enrollment-officers/PASTE_ERIC_ID_HERE/sector?sectorNumber=4

### E1 - add a coverage verification to a COVERED enrollment
POST http://localhost:8085/api/coverage-verifications/save?enrollmentId=PASTE_COVERED_ENROLLMENT1_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "healthCenter": "Kimironko Health Center",
  "remarks": "Coverage valid, consultation approved",
  "dependents": 3
}

### E2 - coverage verification history of a citizen
GET http://localhost:8085/api/coverage-verifications/citizen/1198880123456789

### E3 - delete a coverage verification
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/coverage-verifications/delete/PASTE_VERIFICATION_ID_HERE

### E3 - delete a COVERED enrollment that has verifications (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/delete/PASTE_COVERED_ENROLLMENT1_ID_HERE

### F1 - enrollments per status report
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/stats/by-status

### F2 - cancel all active enrollments of an officer on a day
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/cancel-day?enrollmentOfficerId=PASTE_ALICE_ID_HERE&date=2026-10-20

### Bonus - dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:8085/api/dashboard/summary

### Bonus - paginated enrollments
GET http://localhost:8085/api/enrollments/page?page=0&size=5&sort=enrollmentDate,desc
